PlotTextColor
plotGridLine
plotLegendColor
plotLegendTextColor
plotSHowValColor
plotLineColor(#)
plotLineWidth
Some examples of use are below
*/


/*plotAreaColor=#3a3a3a*/
/*plotBackGroundColor=#3a3a3a*/
/*plotGridColor=#ccc*/
/*plotAxisColor=#ccc*/
/*plotTextColor=#ccc*/
/*plotGridLine=3*/
/*plotSHowValColor=#cc0*/
/* Choices for plotGridLine are integers thus:
    NoPen 0
    SolidLine 1 
    DashLine 2
    DotLine 3
    DashDotLine 4
    DashDotDotLine 5
*/

QGroupBox#plotCtl {margin:0;border:none;border-radius:0;max-height:65px;background:#444}